    "summary": "The Stonesinger’s unit can cast as your [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) closes, provided it is clear of Battle-shock. Roll a D6. A 1 Battle-shocks the Stonesinger’s unit. Choose a visible enemy **MONSTER** or **VEHICLE** within 18″ of the Stonesinger’s unit, excluding **TITANIC** units. Pin the target. The effect expires when your next turn starts. This reduces Move by 2″ and prevents further applications of Pinned while active.",
